  id: aa6
  title: Abilities
  content: 'The hero''s <b>Abilities</b> act passively and with each level make them
    stronger and more effective, both in combat and in travel.


    Each ability
    has three upgrade <b>Levels</b>, and with each new level, its effectiveness increases.


    Also,
    all abilities are divided into three groups: The first is available immediately,
    the second - from hero level <b>10</b>, and the third - from level <b>20</b>.


    To
    upgrade abilities, you need to obtain corresponding <b>Points</b>, which can
    be awarded for completing quests, reading books, and other activities.


    Subsequently,
    if you don''t like your build, you can reset all ability points, but this requires
    special items and a location.'
  section: 4
